,$ | $\\,¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∧¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∨¬Q\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n\nNow, we add a column for $(P∧¬Q)⇒(P∨¬Q).$ This statement is true unless $P∧¬Q$ is true and $P∨¬Q$ is false.\n\n| $\\,P\\,$ | $\\,Q\\,$ | $\\,¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∧¬Q\\,$ | $\\,P∨¬Q\\,$ | $\\,(P∧¬Q)⇒(P∨¬Q)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186572118 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186059700 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1e1c01fd-dea0-5761-9499-d622a34fea3e" :knowledge-point/title "Completing a Truth Table With Compound Statements"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "68759586-67fc-5cf9-bc75-f407e444f60e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186571718} {:answer/id #uuid "78bdf677-2e21-54d9-8bee-395f9a5d048e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{T}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186571748}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "68759586-67fc-5cf9-bc75-f407e444f60e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\text{F}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186571718} :answer-field/id #uuid "52f38d97-0a59-50d0-8f8b-79c118c776ca" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :ans